# {{.Name}} — Claude Guidelines

## Build & Test

```bash
make install        # Install dev tools (templ)
{{- if or (ne .Database "sqlite") (eq .StorageBackend "s3")}}
make docker-up      # Start {{if eq .Database "sqlite"}}RustFS{{else}}PostgreSQL{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if not .MigrateAtStartup}}
make migrate        # Apply database migrations explicitly
{{- else}}
# Migrations run automatically when the server starts
{{- end}}
hamr dev            # Run dev server (file watching, builds, live reload)
make build          # Build binary (generates templ first)
make test           # Run tests
make lint           # Run linters
make templint       # Lint .templ files for silent failures and a11y issues
{{- if or (ne .Database "sqlite") (eq .StorageBackend "s3")}}
make docker-down    # Stop services
{{- end}}
```

